00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.850
<b>How's Limalisha doing?</b>

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:04.680
<b>She's fine.</b>

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.520
<b>I left her in charge of the main force.</b>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.850
<b>I see.</b>

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:12.020
<b>Now, what brings you here? 
Want to embarrass yourself again, Eleonora?</b>

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.450
<b>I'm here to thank you for earlier.</b>

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.360
<b>I appreciate how you helped Lim.</b>

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:21.490
<b>Oh, and I brought you a gift: a slice of humble pie.</b>

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.410
<b>Time to eat up!</b>

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.230
<b>I don't think so.</b>

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.220
<b>Freeze even the heavens themselves!</b>

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.970
<b>Cielo Zam Kafa!</b>

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.560
<b>Tear asunder the air and all who stand in my path!</b>

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.600
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.720
<b>Eisberg!</b>

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.910
<b>You're always looking down on others.</b>

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.450
<b>How does it feel to be on the receiving end for once?</b>

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.370
<b>Stop running your mouth!</b>

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.800
<b>Skewer her, Lavias!</b>

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.050
<b>Slice her to pieces, Arifar!</b>

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.560
<b>So this is what a fight between war maidens looks like.</b>

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.040
<b>Milady, we're—</b>

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:36.770
<b>Stay back!</b>

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.740
<b>This won't take long,</b>

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.820
<b>so stay out of it.</b>

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.670
<b>You're right.</b>

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.240
<b>Time to put an end to this.</b>

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.320
<b>Here I come!</b>

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.740
<b>Who are you?!</b>

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:50.910
<b>A Serrash?!</b>

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.660
<b>Tigre...</b>

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:58.840
<b><i>That man...</i></b>

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.050
<b>Urs...?</b>

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.600
<b><i>Who was the target?</i></b>

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.940
<b>Why'd you save me, Urs?</b>

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.150
<b>Given your skill,</b>

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.110
<b>you could have shot him</b>

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:27.700
<b>after he killed me, right?</b>

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.330
<b>Take it as me returning the favor.</b>

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.420
<b>What favor?</b>

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.170
<b>That tea you poured me was heavenly.</b>

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.670
<b>I'm not trying to flatter you</b>

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.510
<b>because you're a war maiden.</b>

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.260
<b>It really was delicious.</b>

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:52.560
<b>Count Vorn, what do you want from me?</b>

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.940
<b>You staying neutral would be plenty.</b>

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.060
<b>You're not interested in an alliance?</b>

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.650
<b>Of course I am,</b>

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:03.030
<b>but I have nothing to offer you.</b>

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:04.990
<b>You'd only stand to lose.</b>

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.530
<b>You're not in it for personal gain?</b>

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.450
<b>I'm already more than busy with Alsace alone.</b>

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.450
<b>All I want is peace for my homeland.</b>

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.000
<b>You...</b>

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.710
<b>actually mean that, don't you?</b>

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.460
<b>Of course.</b>

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.680
<b>Count Vorn,</b>

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.470
<b>honesty is important.</b>

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.220
<b>However, it can't solve everything.</b>

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.850
<b>Though this time around it's enough.</b>

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:43.230
<b>I hereby promise to keep out of Brune's civil war.</b>

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:47.320
<b>Duke Thenardier will receive
absolutely no support from me!</b>

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.410
<b>Will that do?</b>

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.500
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:59.210
<b>True to her word, Ludmila declared herself neutral afterwards.</b>

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:03.500
<b>She also paid for all the damages caused by the skirmishes between Leitmeritz and Olmütz.</b>

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.760
<b>That's all fine and dandy, Tigre,</b>

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:09.390
<b>Now Elen no longer had to worry about being attacked from the rear,</b>

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.130
<b>but you can't just decide these things on your own!</b>

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.890
<b>Oh, could you be jealous, Eleonora?</b>

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.640
<b>freeing her to concentrate on the war against Thenardier.</b>

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.640
<b>I'll sock you one, runt!</b>

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.760
<b>What'd you call me?!</b>

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.600
<b>However, Thenardier simply made his next move</b>

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.270
<b>as if everything had gone according to plan.</b>

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.770
<b>Using a royal writ,</b>

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.910
<b>he brought another faction into play.</b>

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.120
<b>It's him!</b>

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.280
<b>He's coming for us!</b>

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.780
<b>Is that Roland?!</b>

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.130
<b>Sachstein rats!</b>

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.790
<b>You should learn your lesson and stay away from my country!</b>

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.830
<b>Dýr, god of war, protect us!</b>

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.790
<b>Protect us!</b>

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.590
<b>Clad in black, he wields the invincible sword Durandal.</b>

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:53.300
<b>This is Roland, Brune's mightiest knight.</b>

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.390
<b>Once he took command of the Order of Navarre,</b>

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.980
<b>Brune's western border became impenetrable.</b>

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.440
<b>What is it, Roland?</b>

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.610
<b>An order from His Majesty.</b>

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.200
<b>We're to put down the insurgent.</b>

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.530
<b>The insurgent?</b>

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:13.700
<b>Whom does he mean?</b>

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.580
<b>The Count of Alsace, Tigrevurmud Vorn.</b>

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:23.880
<b>A month had passed since the battle against Olmütz.</b>

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.840
<b>Tigre, with five thousand Zhctedian knights at his back,</b>

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.260
<b>had returned to Brune once more.</b>

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.550
<b>Thanks to you taking care of Olmütz,</b>

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.890
<b>I'm now able to protect my own territory.</b>

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.640
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud, how can I ever repay you?</b>

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.730
<b>I'm the one who should be grateful.</b>

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:49.190
<b>For my men? They're a motley bunch.</b>

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.110
<b>Then again, they make up for it in numbers.</b>

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.910
<b>Please put them to good use.</b>

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.240
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:03.370
<b>Tigre began moving his army to the western tip of Territoire.</b>

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:10.880
<b>There he established a base of operations near Nemetacum, an area controlled by Duke Thenardier.</b>

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.400
<b>Okay, Lim, go ahead and say it.</b>

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.900
<b>S-Silver... Meteor...</b>

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.030
<b>Can we not do this?</b>

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.160
<b>Titta!</b>

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.780
<b>Silver Meteor Stormtroops!</b>

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.530
<b>You see? It just rolls off the tongue.</b>

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.450
<b>In fact, she's saying it with pride.</b>

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:40.450
<b>So why do you have a problem with our army's official name?</b>

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.330
<b>Such a childish name will never raise the troops' spirit!</b>

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.080
<b>How could we use it on the battlefield?!</b>

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.340
<b>It's not like there was a choice, remember?!</b>

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.340
<b>"Allied Army," "Union Army"—</b>

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.090
<b>And then there's figuring out whose name goes first!</b>

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.680
<b>"Silver Meteor Stormtroops!"</b>

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.010
<b>That's awesome, isn't it, Tigre?</b>

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:58.350
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.850
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud, it's your army!</b>

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.850
<b>You should at least have an opinion of your own!</b>

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.600
<b>H-Hey, Titta...</b>

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.150
<b>What do you expect <i>me</i> to say?</b>

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.480
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud!</b>

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.280
<b>Forgive me for interrupting this important meeting.</b>

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.610
<b>Um, there's been another fight.</b>

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:16.950
<b>Again?</b>

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.120
<b>What's the reason this time?</b>

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.410
<b>You see, I don't actually know myself.</b>

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.620
<b>This won't take long.</b>

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.410
<b>Sure.</b>

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.120
<b>You're used to settling arguments by now, after all.</b>

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.340
<b>I'll reheat dinner for you.</b>

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.500
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.840
<b>Your cooking also tastes great cold.</b>

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.380
<b>On the surface everything seems okay.</b>

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.720
<b>But having this many soldiers in our army</b>

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.560
<b>brings its own host of problems.</b>

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:46.520
<b>Come to think of it, Sir Mashas still hasn't returned from the capital.</b>

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:51.650
<b>Has Sir Tigrevurmud's petition actually been delivered to the king?</b>

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:56.900
<b>I hope nothing bad happened to Lord Mashas.</b>

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:01.160
<b>Like I said, I don't want to fight alongside you guys!</b>

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.080
<b>What?!</b>

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:02.910
<b>Break it up!</b>

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.250
<b>You want some? Come here and get it!</b>

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:08.130
<b>I said knock it off!</b>

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.920
<b>You betcha! I won't stop until you're black and blue!</b>

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.090
<b>What's with all this noise?!</b>

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.470
<b>Why are you fighting?!</b>

