00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:34.190
<b>That's funny in its own way.</b>

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.150
<b>Soldiers from both Brune and Zhcted...</b>

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:40.320
<b>Our army's a rag-tag group, 
which means more bickering than normal.</b>

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.740
<b>Please shoot another of those arrows next time.</b>

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.340
<b>Geographically speaking, 
Saunier's the center of the region.</b>

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.510
<b>That's why the local village heads hold their meetings here.</b>

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:04.510
<b>I can also see many outsiders around here.</b>

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.770
<b>I hope we can learn something about what's happening in the capital.</b>

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.940
<b>We've come here because of you, Lord Augre.</b>

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.820
<b>If you need provisions</b>

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:19.950
<b>or anything else our villages can provide, say the word.</b>

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.240
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.070
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.120
<b>We'll make sure to pay for everything.</b>

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.500
<b>You're back sooner than I expected.</b>

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.470
<b>Things went without a hitch.</b>

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.760
<b>I just wish we would've gotten some information about the capital.</b>

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:45.180
<b>It's a bit of a shame, huh?</b>

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.720
<b>What do you plan to do now?</b>

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.560
<b>I'll be heading back to my estate.</b>

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.520
<b>Then I'll see you off.</b>

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.480
<b>Don't be silly, young boy.</b>

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.230
<b>You've got a rare chance here.</b>

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:57.650
<b>Take it easy and enjoy yourself.</b>

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.480
<b>Look!</b>

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.570
<b>There are all sorts of shops on the streets.</b>

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:19.130
<b>If I want to take it easy, 
I've got to do so in a place like this.</b>

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:32.770
<b>You...!</b>

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:43.860
<b>Hey, you! You're Elen's pet... Lunie?</b>

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.410
<b>H-Hey!</b>

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.160
<b>Ah! Lunie, don't run away!</b>

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.860
<b>Oh, dear. Are you hurt?</b>

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.190
<b>Who're you?</b>

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.320
<b>Sofy!</b>

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.780
<b>Did you find Lunie?</b>

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.240
<b>Yes, I did.</b>

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.040
<b>Oh...</b>

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.370
<b>See? Up there.</b>

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.380
<b>Pleased to meet you, Sir Tigrevurmud.</b>

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:47.050
<b>I'm one of the seven war maidens, Sofya Obertas.</b>

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.720
<b>Please call me Sofy.</b>

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.390
<b>Tigrevurmud Vorn.</b>

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.480
<b>I'm terribly sorry about earlier.</b>

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:59.190
<b>I'd never been in the arms of a gentleman before,</b>

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.860
<b>so I was a bit startled.</b>

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.650
<b>Anyway, I'm here on official business.</b>

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.490
<b>The Kingdom of Brune hasn't explained its actions yet.</b>

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.490
<b>Having grown impatient with this conduct,</b>

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.660
<b>His Majesty sent me here as an envoy.</b>

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.750
<b>Lady Sofya,</b>

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:20.750
<b>might we ask how your audience at Brune's royal palace went?</b>

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:26.010
<b>To be honest with you, not very well.</b>

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:27.840
<b>Meaning what?</b>

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:32.680
<b>I was told the King of Brune had taken ill,</b>

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.470
<b>and I was not even able to meet him.</b>

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.020
<b>All I could do was clarify our official stance.</b>

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.830
<b>Your stance?</b>

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.820
<b>You told them Tigre hired me as a mercenary,</b>

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:46.070
<b>and that my actions don't represent Zhcted as a whole.</b>

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.490
<b>Correct.</b>

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.070
<b>Also, I was asked to pass a message</b>

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.780
<b>for Sir Tigrevurmud to you, Elen.</b>

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:54.540
<b>To me?</b>

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.290
<b>"Count Vorn stands accused of treason,</b>

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:04.800
<b>and will hereby be stripped of his rank and title as well as all power granted through them.</b>

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:10.800
<b>Until order can be restored, Alsace will be considered a private holding of His Majesty.</b>

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.680
<b>For now it will remain self-governed</b>

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:16.390
<b>with a new magistrate being dispatched from the capital in due time."</b>

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.190
Count Vorn stands accused of treason,

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.190
and will hereby be stripped of his rank and title as well as all power granted

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.190
through them. Until order can be restored, Alsace will be considered

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.190
a private holding of His Majesty. For now it will remain

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.190
self-governed with a new magistrate being

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.190
dispatched from the capital in due time.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.730
<b>Treason?</b>

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:27.320
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud, I believe that eventually a messenger 
will be dispatched to contact you personally.</b>

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:32.590
<b>Perhaps Sir Mashas will be able to tell you more than I can.</b>

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.620
<b>Sir Mashas?</b>

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.660
<b>You know Sir Mashas?</b>

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.710
<b>I met him in Nice, Brune's capital.</b>

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.620
<b>He had to take care of matters in his own territory,</b>

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.960
<b>so he sent me ahead.</b>

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:48.200
<b>Thank goodness! Lord Mashas is all right!</b>

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.520
<b>I'm a traitor?</b>

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.110
<b>So, what about the other war maidens?</b>

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.400
<b>Mila is...</b>

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.610
<b>You know, don't you?</b>

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:09.940
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:16.450
<b>Elizaveta maintains superficial ties with both Duke Thenardier and Duke Ganelon.</b>

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:20.250
<b>Valentina's principality is situated far away from Brune.</b>

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.660
<b>No need to worry about her.</b>

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.710
<b>No one knows where Olga is.</b>

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.950
<b>She disappeared?</b>

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.250
<b>She set out with her dragon gear. 
That's all we know.</b>

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.760
<b>And I figure Sasha is bedridden, as always.</b>

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.000
<b>Yes.</b>

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:40.270
<b>It's a safe assumption the other war maidens will stay put for a while. There won't be a second Mila.</b>

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:45.470
<b>I'm more concerned about how the Brunemen will act,</b>

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:47.560
<b>now that Sir Tigrevurmud's been branded a traitor.</b>

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.730
<b>The Brunemen?</b>

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.070
<b>Yes.</b>

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.780
<b>Especially regiments serving directly under the king.</b>

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:00.620
<b>Presently, the Order of Navarre is drawing near.</b>

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.870
<b>The captain of this order, Roland,</b>

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.800
<b>is known as the Black Knight.</b>

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:08.500
<b>He's said to be the greatest warrior in all of Brune.</b>

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.050
<b>Even I have heard of him.</b>

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:16.130
<b>Oh, he must be quite famous if his name reached Tigre out in the countryside.</b>

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:21.890
<b>Roland was knighted at the age of thirteen. He has been undefeated ever since.</b>

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:25.190
<b>When he took charge of the Order of Navarre,</b>

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:29.270
<b>the king bestowed upon him Durandal, one of Brune's national treasures.</b>

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.900
<b>Then again, royal knights swear allegiance to His Majesty.</b>

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:36.150
<b>And they will take orders from no one else.</b>

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.910
<b>Let's try sending a messenger for now.</b>

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:46.420
<b>However, the Order of Navarre remained set in its intention to fight.</b>

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.000
<b>The messengers sent by Viscount Augre,</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.420
<b>as well as the messengers sent later by Tigre,</b>

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.920
<b>were turned away.</b>

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:58.090
<b>We thought our enemies were 
Duke Thenardier and Duke Ganelon.</b>

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.220
<b>Why is a chivalric order marching against us?</b>

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:06.390
<b>While the Zhctedians are certainly providing us with great support, they're still foreigners.</b>

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.770
<b>We should instead ally with our fellow Brunemen.</b>

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.040
<b>In other words, you believe the Order of Navarre</b>

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.400
<b>would be able to help us more than the Zhcted army?</b>

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.240
<b>Duke Thenardier has long
been known for his cruelty.</b>

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.240
<b>Same for Duke Ganelon's disregard of the law!</b>

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.580
<b>Have they ever been denounced by an order of knights?</b>

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.210
<b>Have they ever been set straight?!</b>

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:32.960
<b>Well, that's because chivalric orders act only if the king commands it.</b>

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.800
<b>We'll fight!</b>

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.010
<b>All of us!</b>

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.720
<b>For our own sakes!</b>

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.470
<b>You're absolutely correct.</b>

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:46.680
<b>That's why we're here now, seeking help not from knights, but from the army of Zhcted.</b>

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:54.820
<b>The Silver Meteor Stormtroops took up position in the middle of the Orange Plains.</b>

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:59.180
<b>They were facing a line formed by the Order of Navarre, lances at the ready.</b>

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.030
<b>Exterminate the enemies of the crown!</b>

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:09.000
<b>Follow after me!</b>

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:21.470
<b>Lim!</b>

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.860
<b>You've got command!</b>

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.360
<b>It's been a long time since anyone was able to parry my sword.</b>

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.860
<b>What's your name?</b>

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.570
<b>I'm one of the seven war maidens,</b>

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.700
<b>Eleonora Viltaria!</b>

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.870
<b><i>I've fought throughout Sachstein and all of Asvarre,</i></b>

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.250
<b><i>but never have I come across a warrior of her caliber.</i></b>

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.500
<b><i>Could it be that a girl like her...</i></b>

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.840
<b>I am Roland, captain of the Order of Navarre.</b>

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.210
<b>War maiden,</b>

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.710
<b>I don't care why you're here.</b>

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:05.540
<b>As long as I live, no one will enter Brune without His Majesty's leave!</b>

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.890
<b>Milady!</b>

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:09.980
<b>You fools! Stop!</b>

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:27.630
<b><i>If this continues...</i></b>

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.040
<b>I need to use my dragon art.</b>

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.250
<b>But he's only a human...</b>

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.550
<b>Elen!</b>

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.430
<b>You fool! At this distance...!</b>

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.230
<b>Elen!</b>

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:00.980
<b>You won't get away!</b>

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:07.030
<b>Wha—</b>

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.080
<b><i>That wasn't a misfire?!</i></b>

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.390
<b><i>He actually hit his mark?</i></b>

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:20.960
<b>You saved me, Tigre.</b>

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.910
<b>And left him speechless.</b>

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:27.640
<b>Tigre?!</b>

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.010
<b>Tigre!</b>

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:41.610
<b>Sofy!</b>

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.690
<b>I'll take care of this.</b>

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.370
<b>They're all yours!</b>

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.120
<b>Oh, my...</b>

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.630
<b>Gather before me, shining flow!</b>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.510
<b>Falvarna!</b>

